<title>The Space Shuttle - NASA</title>
<meta name="description" content="The world&#039;s first reusable spacecraft launched like a rocket, maneuvered in Earth orbit like a spacecraft and landed like an airplane. It was comprised of the orbiter, the main engines, the external tank, and the solid rocket boosters."/>
